  aciklama:
  - "Telvelerin, \xF6n \u0131zgaras\u0131 {{kelime, geni\u015F | dar}}, {{kelime,
    siyah | beyaz | gri}} renkte, \xF6n farlar\u0131 {{kelime, kedi g\xF6z\xFCn\xFC
    and\u0131ran | kartal g\xF6z\xFCn\xFC and\u0131ran | adeta bir pitonun y\xFCz\xFCn\xFC
    and\u0131ran | ince ve \xE7ekik duran | hafif \xFC\xE7genimsi | bir miktar k\xF6\u015Feli
    duran}}, {{kelime, yuvarlak hatlara sahip, \u015F\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCml\xFC
    | kasl\u0131, spor g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCml\xFC | k\xF6\u015Feli hatlara sahip, agresif
    g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCml\xFC}}, 20{{kelime, 17 | 18 | 19 | 20 | 21}} model oldu\u011Funu
    tahmin etti\u011Fim {{kelime, B | C | D | E | F | J}} segmenti harika bir araba
    ile a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor {{isim}}. S\xFCr\xFCc\xFC kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n
    \xF6n\xFCnde ise galerici {{kelime, olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
    | oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm}}, {{kelime, 30'lu | 40'l\u0131
    | 50'li}} ya\u015Flarda, {{kelime, siyah sa\xE7l\u0131 ve sakals\u0131z | koyu
    kumral, kirli sakall\u0131 | a\xE7\u0131k kumral, kirli sakall\u0131 | koyu kumral,
    sakals\u0131z | a\xE7\u0131k kumral, sakals\u0131z | koyu kumral, b\u0131y\u0131kl\u0131
    | siyah sa\xE7l\u0131, b\u0131y\u0131kl\u0131 | siyah sa\xE7l\u0131, kirli sakall\u0131}}
    bir adam var; araban\u0131n anahtar\u0131n\u0131 adeta sana do\u011Fru uzat\u0131yor.
    Arac\u0131n varsa, {{sayi,3,9}} ay i\xE7inde \u015Fu anki arac\u0131nda olmayan
    {{kelime, koltuk so\u011Futma \xF6zellikli | haf\u0131zal\u0131 koltuklara ve
    park asistan\u0131na sahip | \u015Feritten ayr\u0131lma ikaz\u0131na sahip |
    vakumlu kap\u0131lara sahip | anahtars\u0131z giri\u015F \xF6zellikli | navigasyon
    ve arka e\u011Flence paketi olan | k\xF6r nokta takip sistemine sahip | so\u011Futmal\u0131
    torpidoya sahip | ayarlanabilir s\xFCspansiyon sistemine sahip | elektrikli bagaja
    sahip}} bu ara\xE7la kendi arac\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirece\u011Fini veya
    senin ya da bir aile b\xFCy\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFCn bu arac\u0131 sat\u0131n alaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hissediyorum."
